      "cooked": "<p>No.1</p>\n<p>1. Invaders deal Damage to Dahan and to the land, reduced by Defend. Add Blight if necessary.<br>\n2. Dahan fight back (if any survivors)<br>\n2. Let Them Break Themselves Against the Stone (if Invaders dealt Damage to the land)<br>\n<br>\nNo.2<br>\n1. Invaders deal Damage to Dahan and to stone.<br>\n2. Dahan fight back (if any survivors)<br>\n2. Let Them Break Themselves Against the Stone (if Invaders dealt Damage to the land)<br>\n3. Invaders deal Damage to the land. reduced by Defend. Add Blight if necessary.<br>\n<br>\nWhich way is right?</p>",
